elvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">企业微信官方开源命令行工具wecom-cli，支持AI Agent调用</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenClaw推出中国官方镜像站ClawHub，由字节跳动提供基础设施支持</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d6c681ef9fbbca4f68cc1933dbb32331.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenClaw正式推出中国官方镜像站点ClawHub，旨在解决国内用户访问原站速度受限的问题。该站点由字节跳动旗下BytePlus与火山引擎提供基础设施支持，确保了访问的稳定性与速度。ClawHub持续收录并加速社区内的高质量Agent Skill，所有上架技能均经过基础安全扫描，并提供完整的中文界面。开发者可通过代理地址直接获取资源，或在OpenClaw平台中实现各类技能的无缝调用。此次镜像站的上线，显著降低了国内开发者获取AI工具集的门槛，大幅提升了在Agent开发与应用过程中的访问体验，为国内AI生态的构建提供了更高效的技术支撑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">B站推出专业级AI视频创作工具updream，助力UP主提升创作效率</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6aad6d532ad5e0a3d9886efdc8a5ede7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">B站正式推出专业级AI视频创作助手updream，旨在通过AI技术赋能资深UP主，优化视频生产流程。该工具核心功能涵盖AI智能Agent、个性化技能库及自由创作画布，具备长期深度记忆能力，能够持续学习并沉淀创作者的个人风格，将其转化为可复用的创作技能。updream采用“先内容后形式”的创作逻辑，深度适配B站的内容生态规则与流量分发机制。在保障内容灵魂与个人风格的前提下，该工具通过自动化处理重复性劳动，显著缩短视频制作周期。对于UP主而言，updream不仅是辅助创作的Agent，更是能够沉淀创作资产的智能化平台，有助于在保持高质量输出的同时，大幅降低创作门槛与时间成本。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">企业微信官方开源命令行工具wecom-cli，支持AI Agent调用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9ab2b70692e5db495aebc1dcee940acb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">3月30日，企业微信正式在GitHub开源命令行工具wecom-cli，旨在通过API接口开放核心办公能力，助力开发者构建AI Agent应用。该工具覆盖消息、日程、文档、智能表、会议、待办及通讯录七大核心模块，支持Claude Code、Codex、WorkBuddy及QClaw等主流AI Agent调用。开发者通过Node.js环境配置Bot ID与Secret，即可实现对企业微信数据的读取、写入及任务管理。例如，在日程管理中可查询闲忙状态并更新参与人，在待办任务中可进行状态变更与列表查询。此次开源降低了企业微信与AI Agent的集成门槛，使AI能够更自然地理解并调用办公能力，显著提升了办公场景下AI应用的开发效率与交互体验，为企业数字化办公提供了更灵活的自动化工具链。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm